[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0138","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0138.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18925","title":"Gogs 会话ID验证不当远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Gogs 0.11.66 及之前版本的文件会话提供器（file.go）中存在会话验证缺陷，由于未正确校验会话 ID，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" 路径遍历序列的恶意会话文件，绕过身份认证机制，伪造任意用户会话实现登录。成功利用后攻击者可获取目标系统管理员权限，进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响所有使用文件会话存储的 Gogs 实例，攻击无需任何前置条件，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18925"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-11-04T05:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:48:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 Gogs 至 0.12.0 或更高版本，该版本修复了 session 文件路径遍历导致任意用户登录的问题。如无法升级，在 `app.ini` 中将 `[session] PROVIDER` 从 `file` 切换为 `db` 或 `redis`，并重启 Gogs 服务。同时确保 Gogs 运行环境最小权限，避免攻击者通过其他途径写入 session 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/gogs/gogs/issues/5469","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18925.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18925.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/gogs/CVE-2018-18925/README.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/gogs/CVE-2018-18925/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-18925.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-18925.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/2c6b2e1482debf55f607b200837f63426669df52/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18925.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-18925.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/Web应用漏洞/Gogs 任意用户登录漏洞 CVE-2018-18925.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-18925-3461.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-18925-3462.yaml","https://github.com/j4k0m/CVE-2018-18925"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0138.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0136","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0136.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18777","title":"Microstrategy Web 7 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Microstrategy Web 7 版本中存在目录遍历漏洞，位于 /WebMstr7/servlet/mstrWeb 的 subpage 参数中。经过身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在路径名中使用 /..（斜杠点点）序列绕过 SecurityManager 安全限制，访问父目录中的文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响已废弃的 Microstrategy Web 7 产品，CVSS 评分 4.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18777"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-11-01T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:47:52Z","remediation":"该产品已停止维护，官方不再提供安全补丁。建议立即升级到 MicroStrategy 当前受支持的版本（如 MicroStrategy 2021 及以上），新版本已修复路径遍历问题。如无法升级，可在 Web 服务器或 WAF 层对 `/WebMstr7/servlet/mstrWeb` 路径的 `subpage` 参数实施输入过滤，拒绝包含 `../` 或 `..\\` 的请求，并限制该路径仅允许授权管理员 IP 访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/150059/Microstrategy-Web-7-Cross-Site-Scripting-Traversal.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45755/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45755","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18777.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18777.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3e6c29e1e01675e030a4c7fef4387c8a4c2a1b2f/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18777.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-18777.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-18777-3456.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18777-3454.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18777-3455.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18777-3452.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18777-3451.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-18777.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Microstrategy Web/CVE-2018-18777.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0136.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0135","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0135.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18775","title":"Microstrategy Web 7 Login.asp 参数跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Microstrategy Web 7 版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，由于 Login.asp 页面的 Msg 参数未对用户输入进行充分编码过滤，导致攻击者可在登录页面注入恶意脚本代码。当管理员或其他用户访问该页面时，注入的脚本会在浏览器中执行，造成敏感信息窃取或会话劫持。攻击者无需身份认证，但需诱使用户点击特制链接。该漏洞影响已停止维护的 Microstrategy Web 7 产品，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18775"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-11-01T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:47:52Z","remediation":"该产品（Microstrategy Web 7）已停止维护，官方不再发布安全补丁。建议立即升级到 Microstrategy 仍在支持的最新版本（如 Microstrategy 2021 及以上）；如无法升级，应迁移至受支持的替代产品。临时缓解措施：在 Login.asp 的 Msg 参数输出位置实施严格的 HTML 实体编码（将 < > \" ' & 转义为 &lt; &gt; &quot; &#x27; &amp;），并部署 WAF 规则拦截包含 <script> 等恶意标签的请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/150059/Microstrategy-Web-7-Cross-Site-Scripting-Traversal.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45755/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18775.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18775.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-18775.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/db128d7542b824d8791d4750484399f125519466/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18775.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-18775.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18775-3449.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18775-3446.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18775-3450.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18775-3448.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-18775.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Microstrategy Web/CVE-2018-18775.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0135.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0060","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0060.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-11759","title":"Apache HTTPD mod_jk 访问控制权限绕过漏洞","description":"Apache HTTPD 的 mod_jk 反向代理组件在对请求路径进行 URI-worker 映射匹配前的规范化处理过程中存在路径规范化漏洞，影响 Apache Tomcat JK Connector 1.2.0 至 1.2.44 版本。当通过 httpd 仅暴露部分 Tomcat 支持的 URL 时，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制请求绕过 httpd 层配置的访问控制，直接访问到原本不应暴露的反向代理后的应用功能或资源，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞原理属于路径规范化不完整导致的访问控制绕过（CWE-22），攻击者无需登录凭据，仅需向目标服务器发送精心构造的 HTTP 请求即可触发。此漏洞与 CVE-2018-1323 存在一定重叠但并非同一问题，Red Hat 已将其评级为重要（important）安全漏洞，受影响版本用户应升级至修复版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-11759"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-31T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:36:31Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat Connectors (mod_jk) 至 1.2.45 或更高版本。该版本修复了请求路径规范化处理中的边界情况错误，防止通过构造特殊请求绕过 httpd 访问控制或暴露未授权的 Tomcat 应用路径。操作步骤：从 https://archive.apache.org/dist/tomcat/tomcat-connectors/jk/ 下载对应平台的最新版源码包或二进制包，重新编译安装 mod_jk 模块并替换 httpd 的 modules/ 目录中原有文件，重启 httpd 服务使新模块生效。如短期内无法完成升级，可在 httpd 配置中通过 JkMount 指令精确限制反向代理暴露的 URL 路径范围，同时在防火墙层面禁止外部直接访问 Tomcat 端口，仅允许 httpd 后端访问，以降低访问控制绕过风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105888","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0366","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2019:0367","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/277d42b48b6e9aef50949c0dcc79ce21693091d73da246b3c1981925%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/5b7a23e245c93235c503900da854a143596d901bf1a1f67e851a5de4%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/6d564bb0ab73d6b3efdd1d6b1c075d1a2c84ecd84a4159d6122529ad%40%3Cannounce.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/8d2a579bbd977c225c70cb23b0ec54865fb0dab5da3eff1e060c9935%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/ba661b0edd913b39ff129a32d855620dd861883ade05fd88a8ce517d%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r5c616dfc49156e4b06ffab842800c80f4425924d0f20c452c127a53c%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/rf8e8c091182b45daa50d3557cad9b10bb4198e3f08cf8f1c66a1b08d%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/12/msg00007.html","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4357","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2020.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-11759.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-11759.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/73a4fde210e8a9a135d4150115d3db8b1a81acb9/2018/CVE-2018-11759.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-11759.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-11759-3201.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-11759-3203.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-11759-3205.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/Apache Mod_jk 访问控制权限绕过 CVE-2018-11759.md","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/tomcat-cve-2018-11759.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-11759.yaml","https://github.com/PeiQi0/PeiQi-WIKI-Book/blob/f4596359a8b7b31ae4d231eeaec711706b892ed2/docs/wiki/webserver/Apache/Apache Mod_jk 访问控制权限绕过 CVE-2018-11759.md","https://github.com/YagamiiLight/Cerberus","https://github.com/immunIT/CVE-2018-11759","https://github.com/Jul10l1r4/Identificador-CVE-2018-11759","https://github.com/julioliraup/Identificador-CVE-2018-11759"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0060.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0060.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0060.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0222","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0222.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-14558","title":"Tenda AC7/AC9/AC10 命令注入漏洞","description":"腾达（Tenda）AC7、AC9、AC10系列路由器存在命令注入漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标设备的/goform/setUsbUnload接口发送特制HTTP请求，利用formsetUsbUnload函数对用户输入未做有效过滤直接传递给dosystemCmd函数执行，可注入任意操作系统命令。攻击者可在路由器上执行任意命令，实现完全控制设备、窃取网络流量、发起进一步内网攻击等。该漏洞影响AC7固件版本≤V15.03.06.44_CN、AC9固件版本≤V15.03.05.19(6318)_CN、AC10固件版本≤V15.03.06.23_CN，CVSS评分9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-14558"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-10-30T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:41:11Z","remediation":"升级 Tenda AC7 固件至 V15.03.06.44_CN 以上版本，AC9 固件至 V15.03.05.19(6318)_CN 以上版本，AC10 固件至 V15.03.06.23_CN 以上版本。同时建议禁用路由器的远程管理功能，限制对 Web 管理界面的访问来源，并在网络边界部署入侵检测规则拦截对 /goform/setUsbUnload 的可疑请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/zsjevilhex/iot/blob/master/route/tenda/tenda-01/Tenda.md","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-14558","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-14558.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/95f29039d9df9f64ea752bc1ef04de2ad5981e05/2018/14xxx/CVE-2018-14558.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-14558.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-14558.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a5deeab9684d7cc5d59192453c93e2b5d43622a9/CVE/data/2018/CVE-2018-14558.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-14558.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2018-14558.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-14558.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/91ab7783643591e4c1949aca858fc331aabcb87c/CVEs/2018/CVE-2018-14558.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/eeef281f8f1a9ba894118076ad84b1dde324bda9/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-145xx/CVE-2018-14558.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0222.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0222.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0222.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0137","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0137.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18778","title":"ACME mini_httpd 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"ACME mini_httpd 1.30 之前版本存在任意文件读取漏洞。攻击者可在 HTTP 请求中构造特制的路径（如利用 `%2e%2e%2f` 等编码绕过或直接使用 `../` 路径遍历序列），绕过服务器对文件访问的限制，读取服务器上任意文件（如 `/etc/passwd`、配置文件等敏感信息）。该漏洞源于程序未对用户请求的文件路径进行充分过滤和校验，导致目录遍历攻击。攻击者只需拥有低权限即可远程利用，无需用户交互，对机密性影响严重。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18778"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-29T12:29:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:47:52Z","remediation":"升级 ACME mini_httpd 至 1.30 或更高版本，该版本修复了 URL 路径验证不严导致的任意文件读取漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理（如 Nginx），通过访问控制规则限制对敏感路径（如 /etc/passwd、/proc/ 等）的请求，或禁用 mini_httpd 对符号链接的跟随功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.acme.com/software/mini_httpd/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18778.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18778.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/mini_httpd/CVE-2018-18778/README.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/mini_httpd/CVE-2018-18778/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-18778.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2018/CVE-2018-18778.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-18778.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-18778-3460.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18778-3457.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18778-3458.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-18778-3459.yaml","https://github.com/K3ysTr0K3R/CVE-2018-18778","https://github.com/auk0x01/CVE-2018-18778-Scanner","https://github.com/cyberharsh/Mini_httpd-CVE-2018-18778"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0137.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0134","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0134.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18608","title":"织梦 DedeCMS 5.7 SP2 跨站脚本攻击漏洞","description":"织梦内容管理系统（DedeCMS）5.7 SP2 版本中 `include/datalistcp.class.php` 文件的 `GetPageList` 函数存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该函数在生成模板底部分页导航列表时未对 `PATH_INFO` 参数进行充分的过滤与转义处理，导致攻击者可通过向 `/member/index.php`、`/member/pm.php`、`/member/content_list.php` 或 `/plus/feedback.php` 等页面构造特制的恶意 URL 注入任意 JavaScript 代码。当管理员或普通用户点击该恶意链接后，浏览器会执行攻击者构造的恶意脚本，可能导致会话令牌窃取、后台操作劫持或敏感信息泄露。攻击无需身份认证，但需诱使用户点击链接，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18608"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-23T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:47:35Z","remediation":"立即升级 DedeCMS 至最新版 V5.7.88（2022-01-28 发布），从 GitHub 官方仓库下载覆盖更新。如无法升级，手动编辑 include/datalistcp.class.php 中 GetPageList 函数，对 PATH_INFO 参数使用 htmlspecialchars() 进行 HTML 实体编码转义，防止恶意脚本注入。同时建议在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面添加 WAF 规则，拦截包含 <script> 等敏感关键词的 URL 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ky-j/dedecms/files/2504649/Reflected.XSS.Vulnerability.exists.in.the.file.of.DedeCMS.V5.7.SP2.docx","https://github.com/ky-j/dedecms/issues/8","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18608.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18608.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/db128d7542b824d8791d4750484399f125519466/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18608.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-18608.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-18608.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/织梦内容管理系统 (DedeCMS)/CVE-2018-18608.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2018/18xxx/CVE-2018-18608.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/dce139c84c439e9fc87d0eb2079ddda89aaeb75c/plugins/dedecms/dedecms/CVE-2018-18608.yaml","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-18608.js","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18608.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-18608.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0134.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0073","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0073.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-12675","title":"SV3C L-SERIES HD 摄像头 Web 界面开放重定向漏洞","description":"SV3C L-SERIES 高清网络摄像头 Web 管理界面存在开放重定向漏洞，受影响版本为 V2.3.4.2103-S50-NTD-B20170508B 和 V2.3.4.2103-S50-NTD-B20170823B。漏洞原理是摄像头 Web 界面在重定向用户时未验证目标 URL 的来源合法性，攻击者可构造恶意重定向链接诱导用户点击，将受害者重定向至钓鱼网站或恶意软件分发页面。攻击条件为：需用户交互（点击恶意链接）、网络可达摄像头 Web 界面、无需权限认证。利用方式为攻击者发送包含恶意重定向参数的 URL 给目标用户，用户点击后被重定向至攻击者控制的站点，可导致凭证窃取、恶意代码执行等后果。CVSS 3.0 评分 6.1（中危），CWE-601 分类。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-12675"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-19T22:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:38:09Z","remediation":"建议用户立即更新摄像头固件到最新可提供版本，如果无法更新，请在防火墙中禁用包含`/web/cgi-bin/hi3510/param.cgi`危险URL的访问，并对所有重定向URL进行源验证以防止开放重定向攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.bishopfox.com/news/2018/10/sv3c-l-series-hd-camera-multiple-vulnerabilities/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12675.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-12675.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/f5a1370a5c99053077d951ed65ac8cc8cef6e9f7/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12675.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-12675.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12675-3257.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12675-3258.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-12675-3256.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/Open Redirect/CVE-2018-12675.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/285830d3bc68381daeff2169c3b0a4500df03b19/cves/2018/12xxx/CVE-2018-12675.json","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-12675.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-12675.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0073.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0047","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10823","title":"D-Link 多款路由器 httpd 服务 shell 命令注入漏洞","description":"D-Link 多款路由器（DWR-116、DWR-512、DWR-712、DWR-912、DWR-921、DWR-111）的 httpd 服务器中存在 OS 命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。已认证的攻击者可通过向 chkisg.htm 页面的 Sip 参数注入特制的 shell 命令，在设备上以 root 权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制设备。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10823"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-17T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:34:43Z","remediation":"立即将受影响的 D-Link 路由器固件升级到厂商发布的最新版本。如官方已停止支持（DWR-116/512/712/912/921/111 系列均已停产），应更换为仍在安全更新期内的设备。临时缓解措施：在路由器管理界面关闭远程管理功能，并在防火墙中限制仅信任 IP 可访问 80/443 端口，禁止从 WAN 侧访问管理页面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sploit.tech/2018/10/12/D-Link.html","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Oct/36","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45676","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10823.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10823.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10823.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-10823.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10823-3181.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10823-3184.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10823-3183.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10823-3180.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/D-Link/CVE-2018-10823.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-10823.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/debf0490813d6b24b6eb78e22c421b3f9bcb8d50/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10823.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0046","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10822","title":"D-Link 多款路由器 httpd 服务目录遍历漏洞","description":"The current description field is empty/invalid (it has some garbled content). I need to generate a proper Chinese description for CVE-2018-10822 based on the NVD data and other pre-search information.\n\nLet me synthesize the information:\n- D-Link routers (DWR-116, DIR-140L, DIR-640L, DWR-512, DWR-712, DWR-912, DWR-921, DWR-111)\n- Directory traversal vulnerability in web interface (httpd server)\n- Attack vector: send `GET /uir` with `/..` or `//` in the HTTP request\n- Allows reading arbitrary files\n- CVSS 7.5 HIGH\n- This exists because of incorrect fix for CVE-2017-6190\n- Unauthenticated, network-based, no user interaction needed\n\nLet me write a good Chinese description.D-Link 多款路由器（DWR-116、DIR-140L、DIR-640L、DWR-512、DWR-712、DWR-912、DWR-921、DWR-111）的 web 管理界面 httpd 服务存在目录遍历漏洞。该漏洞源于对 CVE-2017-6190 的修复不完善，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 HTTP 请求的 `/uir` 路径后附加 `/..` 或 `//` 构造恶意 URL，遍历服务器文件系统并读取任意敏感文件（如配置文件、密码哈希等）。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，影响固件版本 DWR-116 至 1.06、DIR-140L/DIR-640L 至 1.02、DWR-512/DWR-712/DWR-912/DWR-921 至 2.02、DWR-111 至 1.01。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10822"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-17T14:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:34:43Z","remediation":"D-Link 仅对 DWR-116 和 DWR-111 提供了固件补丁，建议登录 D-Link 官方支持网站下载并升级到最新固件版本；对于 DIR-140L、DIR-640L、DWR-512、DWR-712、DWR-912、DWR-921 等已停止支持（EOL）的设备，厂商不再发布更新，建议立即更换为仍在支持周期内的路由器型号。临时缓解措施：在路由器管理界面中禁用远程 Web 管理功能，并在网络防火墙层面限制对路由器 80/443 端口的访问来源，仅允许受信任的内部 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sploit.tech/2018/10/12/D-Link.html","https://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2018/Oct/36","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45678","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10822.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10822.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10822.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-10822.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10822-3176.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10822-3175.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10822-3179.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-10822-3178.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-10822.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/D-Link/CVE-2018-10822.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-10822.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0046.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0177","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0177.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-3238","title":"Oracle Fusion Middleware WebCenter Sites 未授权数据访问漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 的 WebCenter Sites 组件 Advanced UI 子组件存在权限控制不当漏洞。具有高权限的攻击者可通过 HTTP 网络访问利用该漏洞，但需要目标系统上的其他用户进行交互配合。成功利用后可导致未授权读取关键数据乃至完全访问所有 WebCenter Sites 可访问数据，同时可对部分数据进行未授权更新、插入或删除操作，且攻击影响可能波及其他关联产品。该漏洞影响 WebCenter Sites 11.1.1.8.0 版本，CVSS 评分 6.9，危害等级中危。Oracle 已在 2018 年 10 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2018-3238"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-17T01:31:25Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:57:18Z","remediation":"立即登录 My Oracle Support，下载并应用 Oracle 2018 年 10 月关键补丁更新 (CPUOct2018) 中针对 WebCenter Sites 的安全补丁。受影响版本为 11.1.1.8.0 和 12.2.1.3.0，请升级至对应补丁版本。如无法立即打补丁，可限制对 Advanced UI 组件的网络访问权限，仅允许受信管理员 IP 通过 HTTP 访问，并启用严格的身份验证与会话管理机制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuoct2018-4428296.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105640","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-3238.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-3238.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2018/CVE-2018-3238.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-3238.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-3238.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-3238-3537.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-3238-3539.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-3238-3538.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-3238/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-3238.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2018/CVE-2018-3238.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Oracle Fusion Middleware/CVE-2018-3238.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0177.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0176","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0176.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-3167","title":"Oracle E-Business Suite Application Management Pack SSRF漏洞","description":"Oracle E-Business Suite 的 Application Management Pack 组件中的 lcmServiceController.jsp 存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 协议向目标系统发送特制请求，利用该漏洞伪造服务端发起内部请求，从而未授权读取 Application Management Pack 中的敏感数据。该漏洞影响 Oracle E-Business Suite 12.1.3、12.2.3、12.2.4、12.2.5、12.2.6 及 12.2.7 版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。Oracle 已在 2018 年 10 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2018-3167"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-17T01:31:19Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:57:08Z","remediation":"立即应用 Oracle 2018 年 10 月关键补丁更新（CPU Oct 2018）中针对 Application Management Pack for Oracle E-Business Suite 的安全补丁。登录 My Oracle Support，参考文档 Note 2445688.1 获取对应版本的 E-Business Suite 补丁编号并安装。对于 12.1.3 版本，升级至包含该修复的累积补丁；对于 12.2.3~12.2.7 版本，应用对应 R12.2 系列的 CPU 补丁。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络层面限制对 /lcmServiceController.jsp 的未授权访问，仅允许受信任 IP 访问 EBS 管理页面作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuoct2018-4428296.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105627","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1041897","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-3167.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-3167.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-3167.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-3167.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2018-3167-3533.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/low/cve-2018-3167-3531.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-3167-3536.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-3167-3535.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-3167-3532.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-3167_重复副本.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-3167.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0176.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0176.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0176.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0132","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0132.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-18323","title":"CentOS Web Panel 本地文件包含漏洞","description":"CentOS Web Panel（CWP）0.9.8.480 版本 admin/index.php 存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造包含 `../` 的 `file` 参数（如 `admin/index.php?module=file_editor&file=/../../../etc/passwd`）读取服务器上任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞利用难度低，无需用户交互，影响所有运行 CWP 0.9.8.480 的服务器。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-18323"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-15T07:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:46:59Z","remediation":"立即将 CentOS Web Panel (CWP) 升级至最新版本（当前为 0.9.8.1235 以上），可通过官方更新脚本 `/scripts/update_cwp` 一键升级。如无法立即升级，在 Nginx/Apache 反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截 `admin/index.php` 中 `file` 参数包含 `../` 的请求，并限制 `module=file_editor` 仅允许白名单 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://0day.today/exploit/31304","https://seccops.com/centos-web-panel-0-9-8-480-multiple-vulnerabilities/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45610/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18323.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-18323.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2018/CVE-2018-18323.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/470882de1d838c0314a2db2fc03b1761bf6b881f/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-18323.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-18323.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-18323-3438.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-18323-3439.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-18323-3437.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-18323-3436.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/LFI/CVE-2018-18323.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/CentOS Web Panel/CVE-2018-18323.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0132.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0035","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0035.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-10141","title":"Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS GlobalProtect Portal 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS 的 GlobalProtect Portal 登录页面存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。由于该页面未对用户输入的参数进行严格过滤和转义，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过构造包含恶意 JavaScript 或 HTML 代码的特制 URL 链接，诱导目标用户访问。一旦用户点击该链接，恶意脚本将在其浏览器会话中执行，从而导致敏感 Cookie 泄露、会话劫持或页面内容篡改。该漏洞影响 PAN-OS 8.1.3 及之前版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-10141"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-12T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:33:35Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS 升级至 8.1.4 或更新版本，以修复 GlobalProtect Portal 登录页面的跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。在无法立即升级的环境中，建议通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）拦截包含恶意 JavaScript 脚本的异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["https://security.paloaltonetworks.com/CVE-2018-10141","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10141.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-10141.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/9979ce144c257f1c427a75604f8c0ffbc8293390/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-10141.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-10141.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-10141-3163.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-10141-3164.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-10141-3161.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2018/10xxx/CVE-2018-10141.json","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS/CVE-2018-10141.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-10141.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/ARPSyndicate/nuclei/cvescan/medium/CVE-2018-10141.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0035.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0221","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0221.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-9206","title":"Blueimp jQuery-File-Upload 任意文件上传漏洞","description":"Blueimp jQuery-File-Upload 组件（版本 ≤ 9.22.0）存在未授权任意文件上传漏洞。该漏洞源于文件上传功能未对上传文件类型进行有效校验，未认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器上传恶意的 PHP 等可执行脚本文件，直接获取 WebShell 权限，进而完全控制服务器。攻击无需任何身份认证，仅需目标部署了受影响版本的 jQuery-File-Upload 组件且上传目录可执行脚本即可利用。该漏洞影响大量使用该组件的 Web 应用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-9206"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-10-11T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:06:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Blueimp jQuery-File-Upload 至 v9.22.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了未经验证的文件上传漏洞。如无法升级，可在服务端 upload 目录配置严格的文件类型白名单（仅允许图片等安全类型），并对上传接口添加身份认证与 CSRF 防护作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/105679","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/106629","http://www.vapidlabs.com/advisory.php?v=204","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9136","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45790/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46182/","https://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujan2019-5072801.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45584","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9206.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2018/CVE-2018-9206.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2018/CVE-2018-9206.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/400ed050b78dffbc3594fd5bafe67494479fdfd3/2018/CVE-2018-9206.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e80f5d408ffad16b39381a0b04b1a01a2a54c308/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-9206.yaml","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/42afd254d53725a0da501aa4583bda786dddcd0d/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-9206.md","https://github.com/lcashdol/Exploits/blob/d724909e5a28e29e31290f3514d681db2b0038b8/CVE-2018-9206/CVE-2018-9206.sh","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2018/CVE-2018-11228.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/91cd776dc52d69c44e28d74a7360b0df58c99c7e/2018/CVE-2018-9206.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/42afd254d53725a0da501aa4583bda786dddcd0d/data/2018/CVE-2018-9206-Stahlz_JQShell.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a0edea60322bafbed67887cf7a4d97a55df8a9fa/cves/2018/9xxx/CVE-2018-9206.json","https://github.com/Stahlz/JQShell","https://github.com/Den1al/CVE-2018-9206","https://github.com/flame-11/CVE-2018-9206-jquery-file-upload","https://github.com/cved-sources/cve-2018-9206","https://github.com/liemkaka/CVE-2018-9206"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0221.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0221.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0221.toml"}]